---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Guide">
  <div class="container page-hero"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="使用指南">Guide</div><h1 data-zh="从一条更好的回复开始。">Make the next reply yours.</h1><p class="lead" data-zh="Reply Copilot 目前处于内测。本指南说明本地安装和使用流程，不提供虚构的 Chrome 商店链接。">Reply Copilot is in beta. These steps describe local installation and use; there is no Chrome Web Store listing yet.</p></div>
  <section class="container section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="grid-3"><div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">1</span><h3 data-zh="构建并加载插件">Build and load</h3><p data-zh="从项目源码执行 npm run build:dev；在 Chrome 扩展程序页面开启开发者模式，加载 dist/development。">Run npm run build:dev in the extension repository. In Chrome Extensions, enable Developer mode and load dist/development.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">2</span><h3 data-zh="设置你的风格">Set your voice</h3><p data-zh="在中文设置中心填写 Voice Profile、兴趣和写作样本。已有本地 Key 的开发者可继续使用 BYOK。">Add your Voice Profile, interests, and writing samples. Developers with a local key can continue using BYOK.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">3</span><h3 data-zh="检查并发送">Review and send</h3><p data-zh="打开 X 帖子的回复框，选择建议、编辑文字，确认合适后由你自己点击发送。">Open a reply on X, choose a suggestion, edit it, then press Send yourself when ready.</p></div></div><p class="notice" style="margin-top:25px" data-zh="免费试用需要官网与云端服务上线后才能供公众使用；本地开发环境可以完整联调。">Public trials become available after the website and cloud service launch. The full flow can be exercised in local development.</p></section>
</Base>
